Follow standards/skill-authoring.md. Keep packages self-contained and use standard-library
Python helpers for deterministic work. Preserve unknown facts and source IDs. Run
scripts/build_manifest.py, scripts/validate.py, and meaningful tests after changes.
Do not claim native-client behavior was tested unless the client was actually exercised.
